  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a9574f4f4c5eddf4a8ebe8d045512c4b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  storyImage: {fileID: 887460573}
  storyText: {fileID: 141243702}
  pageIndicator: {fileID: 977192282}
  prevButton: {fileID: 997339401}
  nextButton: {fileID: 1652185336}
  nextButtonText: {fileID: 0}
  pageSprites:
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 90b473a8ec6d0da4294c2bd7091a58d6, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 878308a9a17c596498f7ee03559ecbd9, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -31836691, guid: d53f546f58021ba4382acd63be6eefea, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 749143213, guid: d53f546f58021ba4382acd63be6eefea, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 269536b579a97664fad5496ed27fe62a, type: 3}
  pageTexts:
  - "You are a humble farmer in a medieval village. One day, while working your fields,
    you found a strange key half-buried in the soil. You brought it home \u2014 and
    that night, everything changed."
  - Strange anomalies began appearing across the village. Twisted creatures roamed
    the roads. Purple thorns spread through the forest. Corrupted water poisoned
    the land. The key had awakened something ancient.
  - "A wandering wizard found you and revealed the truth: the key is bound to a dark
    power. To restore the world, you must purify it using three sacred statues hidden
    across the land. But beware \u2014 false idols lurk among them, ready to drag
    you into another world."
  - "The path will not be easy. Monsters block your way \u2014 fight them or ignore
    them, the choice is yours. A dark sorcerer controls this broken world and will
    not let you succeed without a final battle."
  - Light campfires to heal. Activate the stars to find your way. Purify the key,
    defeat the sorcerer, and bring your village back to peace. The journey is yours
    alone. Good luck, farmer.
